{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479645-sc-2e-demigod-scale-revisited-extended","id":1479645,"title":"[Sc 2E Demigod] Scale Revisited Extended","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-27T23:11:24-07:00","id":1479645,"title":"[Sc 2E Demigod] Scale Revisited Extended","content":"<b>Scion</b> 2E <b>Demigod</b> book is showing Revisited take on Scale. In book, table goes up to Scale 6 in each category - but implies that whole Earth/World would be Scale 9 for Size Scale. What would be your more extreme examples for other higher levels in categories, like Scale 7-9?<br /> <br /> For basic recognition on what Scale levels we talk about quote from <b>Demigod</b> \u2013 rest in book.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Scale 0 \u2013 Baseline</b></span><br /> <b>Durability</b> \u2013 Basic clothing<br /> <b>Leadership</b> \u2013 Your neighbor<br /> <b>Mental</b> \u2013 Normal person<br /> <b>Power</b> \u2013 Amateur athlete<br /> <b>Might</b> \u2013 Knife or handgun<br /> <b>Size </b>\u2013 Person-sized<br /> <b>Speed</b> \u2013 Decent sprinter<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Scale 1 \u2013 Elite</b></span><br /> <b>Durability </b>\u2013 Kevlar armor<br /> <b>Leadership</b> \u2013 Upper management<br /> <b>Mental</b> \u2013 Chess grandmaster<br /> <b>Power</b> \u2013 Gorilla<br /> <b>Might</b> \u2013 Anti-personnel riffle<br /> <b>Size</b> \u2013 Horse or Deer<br /> <b>Speed</b> \u2013 Cheetah, car<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Scale 6 \u2013 Titanic</b></span><br /> <b>Durability </b>\u2013 Exotic matter not of this universe<br /> <b>Leadership</b> \u2013 Important God in the Pantheon<br /> <b>Mental</b> \u2013 Omniscient intellects<br /> <b>Power</b> \u2013 Moving of tectonic plate<br /> <b>Might</b> \u2013 Strategic thermonuclear device<br /> <b>Size</b> \u2013 Megalopolis<br /> <b>Speed</b> \u2013 Speed of Light<br /> [END of Table in book here]<br /> <br /> Scale seems a bit unbalanced here \u2013 if Size Scale 9 is Earth/World \u2013 then why Speed 6 is Speed of Light? As Speed of Light it scientific maximum of speed in universe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-28-2022, 06:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-28T01:31:13-07:00","id":1479650,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the immediate derail, but does this imply that anyone with access to Kevlar gets scale on defense?<br /> <br /> More on topic... yeah, the speed of light should definitely be the highest scale possible, unless the game is actually going to put forward entities that actually exceed the speed of light.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-28T03:45:46-07:00","id":1479652,"title":"","content":"If you really want a higher scale example, there is always TC Aberrant that goes all the way to 10 (remember just that human scale in TC is 1, not 0 as in Scion).<br /> <br /> But those tables of scale sometimes get everyone confused, the Kevlar as Scale 1 for example is a bit confusing. My suggestion is to ignore Kevlar as a scale 1 reference and consider something like a anti-bomb armor as Scale 1 armor (maybe add a tag to allow you to increase scale in exchange of comfort / mobility.<br /> <br /> On Speed of light as scale 6, I would say no in a general scientific way, but if you plan to have FTL trips around the universe, 6 is a pretty good c as scale 6, with 7+ being Warp 2+<br /> In TC there is Speed Scale (going 1-10) with 10 being c, but also Space Speed (going 1-5), with 6 being c. Space Speed is kind of a relic from 1e Trinity, but it works fine to prevent a airplane to be able to fly to space, and things like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-29T09:29:58-07:00","id":1479704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HighPriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479645-sc-2e-demigod-scale-revisited-extended?p=1479650#post1479650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the immediate derail, but does this imply that anyone with access to Kevlar gets scale on defense?</div> </div> </div> </div>An anti-personnel rifle is also Scale 1 now (counteracts Kevlar's Scale). In Origin an anti-<i>tank</i> rifle was Scale 1, so Kevlar's Scale would have been closer to 0.<br /> <br /> Maybe Soft Armor should just improve Defensive Scale instead of making Inflict Injury more difficult?<br /> <br /> Defense with Kevlar (+1 Soft Armor):<ul><li>Opponent1 rolls 3 successes on a Firearms (handgun) roll</li> <li>I roll Defense, getting 1s. (Defense is 2)</li> <li>After applying Defense, Opponent has 1s to hurt me. Inflict Injury costs 1s (because of 1 Soft Armor). He can spend that to hurt me</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Defense with Scale (Kevlar is +1 Defensive Scale):<ul><li>Opponent rolls 3 successes on a Firearms (handgun) roll</li> <li>I roll Defense, getting 1s + 2e (Defense is 4)</li> <li>After applying Defense, Opponent can't do anything to me.</li> </ul><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","name":"Ashnak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}